<html>

<head>
    <title>Quiz</title>
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body>
    {% include "navigation.njk" %}
    <form class="quiz-text" method="POST" action="/submit-quiz">
        <label>
            <b class="typed-question">What's your name?</b>
            <input class="type-box" type="text" placeholder="Name" name="name">
        </label>

        <div class="question">
            <b>Q1: It's the night before a big deadline. You're...</b>
            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q1" value="A"> Checking your work again for the fifth time
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q1" value="B" /> Finished it early and already in bed
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q1" value="C" /> Playing music and making it fun
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q1" value="D" /> Annoyed someone gave you this much work
            </label>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
            <b>Q2: A friend hasn't replied in a few hours. You...</b>
            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q2" value="A"> Reread your last message to see if you said something wrong
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q2" value="B" /> Don't really notice
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q2" value="C" /> Send them multiple funny memes to make them reply
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q2" value="D" /> Feel ignored and a little irritated
            </label>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
            <b>Q3: Your ideal Friday night is...</b>
            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q3" value="A"> Lying on your bed thinking about life
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q3" value="B" /> A quiet walk in a park
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q3" value="C" /> Out with friends somewhere loud
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q3" value="D" /> Anywhere without slow walkers and crowds
            </label>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
            <b>Q4: Plans get cancelled at the last minute. You think...</b>
            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q4" value="A"> "Was it because of me?"
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q4" value="B" /> "Okay, more time to rest."
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q4" value="C" /> "Let's find something else fun to do!"
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q4" value="D" /> "Why didn't they tell me earlier?"
            </label>
        </div>

        <div class="question">
            <b>Q5: Your friends would most likely describe you as...</b>
            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q5" value="A"> The one who always has a backup plan
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q5" value="B" /> The one who never panics
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q5" value="C" /> The one who makes everyone laugh
            </label>

            <label class="option">
                <input type="radio" name="q5" value="D" /> The one who speaks up when disagreeing with something
            </label>
        </div>

        <label>
            <b class="typed-question">Say something before moving in. </b>
            <input class="type-box" type="text" placeholder="Say something..." name="message">
        </label>
        <input class="submit-button" type="submit" value="Move In">
    </form>
</body>

</html>